(7226150, 1115183, 150277, '<td valign="top">I should have  guessed.  But they look so much like real fish - good decorations.  I like the color of the rocks - although as I looked closer there were a few items at the very top of the photo (black) that might have distracted.  (Honestly I did not notice until now, but some folks look really closely so maybe a slightly tighter crop so those items weren''t visible?)  Will they run water through this as summer comes about?  It really does look like a nice little stream.</td>', 'I should have  guessed.  But they look so much like real fish - good decorations.  I like the color of the rocks - although as I looked closer there were a few items at the very top of the photo (black) that might have distracted.  (Honestly I did not notice until now, but some folks look really closely so maybe a slightly tighter crop so those items weren''t visible?)  Will they run water through this as summer comes about?  It really does look like a nice little stream.', '2014-06-09 10:14:41.000000', NULL, 0),
